// TERRTY determines the type of terrain in a square
//    type     name        code
//      0      ?             unchanged
//     7F (3F) border        9
//    <07      mountain      1
//    <4B (0B) city          2
//    <4F (0F) frozen swamp  3
//    <69 (29) frozen river  4
//    <8F (0F) swamp         5
//    <A4 (24) river         6   if [LAT] >= 0E  and <A9 is also 6
//    <BA (3A) coastline     7   if [LAT] >= 0E  and <BB is also 7
//    <BD (3D) ?             8   
